  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> Your foe slams you to the ground and then stomps on your shin, breaking both tibia and fibula. Those two long bones shatter into sharp shards that tear out through the skin like bony daggers!</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Prone], @Condition[Bleeding] (1) and @Condition[Stunned] (3). If you receive Surgery within a week the injury will count as a Broken Bone (Major) except you’ll fail all Tests for long-term penalties. Otherwise you’ll lose use of the leg permanently (see under Amputated Parts). Regardless, you contract a Festering Wound from the open fracture.</p>"
    },
